        </div>

        <!-- Top Image Row -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center items-center md:items-stretch gap-12 md:gap-16 border-2 border-black p-8 md:p-12 pt-16 md:pt-20 lg:pt-24 bg-gray-50/30">
            <!-- Drew block -->
            <div class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row items-center xl:items-start pt-2 gap-6 xl:gap-8 justify-end w-full md:w-1/2">
                <div class="font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs xl:max-w-[280px] shrink xl:text-right border-l-2 xl:border-l-0 xl:border-r-2 border-black/20 pl-4 xl:pl-0 xl:pr-4 py-2">
                    <p class="font-bold mb-2 uppercase text-black">Hi, I'm Drew.</p>
                    <p class="text-black/70">I study physics at the University of Pennsylvania and fell in love with digital design because it allows me to connect my analytical programming techniques and translate them into beautiful art. In my free time, I also like to research whales.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 shrink-0">
                    <img src="/images/photo1.jpg" alt="Drew" class="w-48 md:w-56 xl:w-64 aspect-[4/5] object-cover object-[35%_center] border-2 border-black transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.03]" />
                    <span class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">(Drew)</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Lionel block -->
            <div class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row items-center xl:items-start pt-2 gap-6 xl:gap-8 justify-start w-full md:w-1/2">
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 shrink-0">
                    <img src="/images/photo2.png" alt="Lionel" class="w-48 md:w-56 xl:w-64 aspect-[4/5] object-cover border-2 border-black transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.03]" />
                    <span class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">(Lionel)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs xl:max-w-[280px] shrink xl:text-left border-l-2 border-black/20 pl-4 py-2">
                    <p class="font-bold mb-2 uppercase text-black">Hi, I'm Lionel.</p>
                    <p class="text-black/70">I study economics and data science at Wesleyan University. I teach a dual-enrollment programming class to high schoolers around the country; I love to teach programming because I believe it is a means to fully express yourself. When I also run a pizza pop-up for fun!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>



      <!-- Card 2: Our Mission -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-16 items-start border-2 border-black p-6 md:p-12 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors duration-500 group">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest md:w-1/5 shrink-0 pt-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 border-2 border-black group-hover:border-white transition-colors"></span>
